==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-take care.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|take<,,took,taken> care}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To be [[cautious]], [[careful]] or [[prudent]].
#: '''''Take care''' when you’re crossing the crosswalk''.
#: '''''Take care''' that you don't fall!''
#: '''''Care''' should be '''taken''' to close it securely.''
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[mind]], or be [[in charge]] of something.

